    <Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#F7F4EC", lineHeight: 1.25 }}>Agent behavior lives in the wrapper.</Text>
      <Box style={{ width: 70, height: 3, background: "#06B6D4", marginTop: 22, marginBottom: 22 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "#F7F4EC" }}>Prompts, tools, routing, and policy text decide what a support agent actually does.</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, lineHeight: 1.35, color: "#F7F4EC", opacity: 0.9 }}>If the wrapper is not versioned, the team cannot explain a win — or a regression.</Text>
  </Box>
